## 4. Suggested order of work (each step ends in a verifiable state)

1. Step 1 + Step 2 — deps, env, browser client. App still boots.
2. Step 3 + Step 4 — hooks + types. `safeGetSession()` returns `null`s; `npm run check` is clean.
3. Step 5 — layout wiring. Nav renders logged-out state.
4. Step 6 + Step 7 — login form and logout. You can log in and out. **First usable milestone.**
5. Step 8 — email confirmation. Sign-up round trip works end to end.
6. Step 9 — guard + `(private)` group, plus the `safeRedirect` unit test.
7. Step 10 — harden the LiveKit token endpoint.
8. Step 11 — Playwright coverage, then `check`/`lint`/`test`.

